    "Port Redis aggregation from Spring XD wiki using Redis Hashes/Sorted Sets for field-value counters; implement continuous write aggregation (U3/U4).",
    "Isolate Hadoop tests by creating a separate Maven module with a dedicated profile to exclude from default build, fixing Eclipse CP generation (U5).",
    "Provision EC2 YARN cluster via automation (e.g., CloudFormation) for acceptance tests; integrate with CI/CD for every build (U6).",
    "Expose HTTP source module message size limit via servers.yml configuration property, binding to Netty HttpChunkAggregator (U8)."
  ],
