    "Old Spring XD wiki implementation for aggregation is accessible and can be used as reference.",
    "EC2 environment for YARN can be provisioned automatically for CI integration.",
    "HTTP source module uses Netty and HttpChunkAggregator is configurable via a property.",
    "All effort estimates are for a single skilled developer; no major refactoring beyond described scope is required.",
    "Unit tests use JUnit/Mockito; integration tests use Spring Test with embedded Redis/Hadoop and EC2 for acceptance tests.",
    "U3 and U4 are duplicate requirements; only one implementation effort is estimated."
  ],
